OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor sacked after posting
OL,4,Asexualised AI image of colleague
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has been sacked
OL,7,Fafter he posted a sexualised
OL,8,FAI-generated image of a female
OL,9,Fcolleague on social media.
OL,11,FThe since-deleted post was published on
OL,12,FX by Christopher Hudson, cabinet member
OL,13,Ffor highways and transport at Suffolk
OL,14,FCounty Council, at 15:44 GMT on Monday.
OL,16,FIt included an image which showed
OL,17,FReform UK councillor June Mummery in a
OL,18,Ftight, sequined bra with the slogan "I
OL,19,Fsaved the Suffolk school nurses!".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
